DigiCert EV RSA CA G2 - intermediate CA supplement for www.wsdot.wa.gov.

Why this file exists: WSDOT's 2026-08-19 site maintenance left their
server presenting a BARE leaf certificate (CN=wsdot.wa.gov, EV) with no
intermediate. Browsers and iOS repair that via AIA chasing; strict
clients (ours) correctly refuse: CERTIFICATE_VERIFY_FAILED, "unable to
get local issuer certificate" - which took every WSDOT poller down and
masqueraded as a cloud-IP block. Supplying the intermediate locally
keeps FULL verification: the chain must still anchor at a trusted root
(DigiCert Global Root G2, present in system/certifi stores).

Provenance: fetched 2026-08-20 from the leaf's own AIA URL,
http://cacerts.digicert.com/DigiCertEVRSACAG2.crt
sha256 95:88:EF:74:19:9E:45:AC:EF:CC:CF:C0:C4:70:10:E9:F2:A3:7A:1D:D4:4C:61:A4:E1:C6:B3:34:DA:5A:F6:14
Validity: 2020-07-02 to 2030-07-02. Harmless once WSDOT fixes their
chain; delete this file (and _tls_context's load of it) when they do.

